From: ryoma-89 <ryoma-89@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 17:21:46 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] gfxstream: forward device-side acceleration structures and
 ray query

Velox-local change (biblioklept). VK_KHR_acceleration_structure and
VK_KHR_ray_query are generated for the guest and listed only when the host
lists them and debug.velox.ray_tracing=1. Deferred host operations use the
Mesa common entrypoints. Builds are sent as
vkCmdBuildAccelerationStructuresFlatGOOGLE with ppGeometries folded into
pGeometries and the range infos flattened; build sizes fold ppGeometries too.
The geometry union is serialized and deep copied by the active member's
sType, address unions deep copy only the device address, and batched
descriptor commits carry acceleration structure writes.

